付金が行き渡るように努めてまいりますと、再給付の必要についてどう考えているのか、よく分からない答弁でございました。…", "…い答弁でございました。改めて厚生労働省に伺いますが、既に決まっている給付金が行き渡った後、再給付の必要についてどうお考えか、教えてください。"]}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/11", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/13", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/15", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/17", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/19", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/21", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/23", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/25", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120414080X01020210610/28", "sentence": []}]}]}, {"date": "2021-12-16", "meeting": [{"meeting_name": "参議院 予算委員会", "remarks": [{"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/319", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/321", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/323", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/325", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/327", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/329", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/331", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/333", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/335", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/337", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/339", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261X00120211216/341", "sentence": []}, {"url": "https://kokkai.ndl.go.jp/txt/120715261